      "en": "But it displeased Jonah exceedingly, and he was angry.",
      "ko": "요나가 심히 싫어하고 노하여",
      "source_text_hash": "3383b7fce6472ed853493e493450e941d19bce202fad540527ee726ee7d38f0d",
      "translation_text_hash": "57e85c728afef7b002eef3a48c5ded81bf925e67cc7eb073e3e024107baca627",
